        "subject": "Your AI Resume Feedback Report",
        "message": "=<h2>🎯 Your AI Resume Feedback Report</h2>  <p>Hello,</p>  <p>Our AI Placement Agent has analyzed your resume. Here is your personalized feedback:</p>  <h3>📊 ATS Score</h3> <p><strong>{{$json.atsScore}} / 100</strong></p>  <h3>💪 Strengths</h3> <ul>   <li>{{ $json.strengths.join('</li><li>') }}</li> </ul>  <h3>⚠️ Areas to Improve</h3> <ul>   <li>{{ $json.weaknesses.join('</li><li>') }}</li> </ul>  <h3>📚 Missing Skills</h3> <ul>   <li>{{ $json.missingSkills.join('</li><li>') }}</li> </ul>  <h3>🚀 Suggestions</h3> <ul>   <li>{{ $json.suggestions.join('</li><li>') }}</li> </ul>  <h3>📝 Overall Feedback</h3> <p>{{$json.overallFeedback}}</p>  <hr>  <p><strong>AI Placement Agent</strong></p> <p>Keep learning, keep building, and keep improving. 🚀</p>",
